[36m(TaskRunner pid=580578)[0m \[9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=580578)[0m \[9b + 7 = k(b + 7)\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=580578)[0m for some integer \(k\). Rearranging the equation, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=580578)[0m \[9b + 7 = kb + 7k\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=580578)[0m \[9b - kb = 7k - 7\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=580578)[0m \[b(9 - k) = 7(k - 1)\]
